1785542587345800	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyyAQ		item.comment	bn-3qsa	{"body":"PR-4A IMPL-03 delivered (commit 5a1a6be in workspace bn-3qsa). RFC 0012 T0/T1 ladder implemented by extending the three seed modules plus Temporal and the DieHard example.\n\nT0 (transition-system safety), 41 theorems: reachability induction (reachable_satisfies, reachable_isInductive, reachable_least, reachable_iff_exists_path, isStutterRun_reachable/isRun_reachable); inductive invariant preservation (safety_iff_exists_inductiveInvariant = relative completeness, InductiveInvariant.and/top/mono/holds_on_path, always_of_inductiveInvariant); finite closure certificate soundness (ClosureCertificate.provesSafety/isInductiveInvariant/exists_iff_safety plus a new executable FiniteSystem with reflective checker: checkClosure_eq_true_iff, checkClosure_sound, checkClosure_provesSafety, checkClosure_eq_false_of_unclosed/_missing_init); counterexample path validity (PathFrom inductive, pathFrom_append, reachable_endpoint, reachable_of_initial_path, exists_path_of_reachable, checkTrace_sound, checkCounterexample_sound, no_closure_of_counterexample). Instantiated on Die Hard: 16-state closure certificate accepted (proves TypeOK + the measurement invariant), three malformed certificates rejected, recorded solution accepted as a counterexample path proving four gallons reachable.\n\nT1 (stuttering and refinement), 17 theorems: safety preservation (StutteringSimulation.maps_reachable/transfer_safety, new ReachableSimulation with invariant-relative step obligation, maps_reachable/transfer_safety/of_inductiveInvariant); composition (refl, compose, ReachableSimulation.compose); observer projection and hidden-event closure (TransitionSystem.observe quotient, observe_step_visible, observe_simulation, observe_reachable_iff, observe_safety_iff = sound and complete for observation-only safety); history/auxiliary variable erasure (HistoryAugmentation, erasure_simulation, reachable_lift, erases_safety iff); conditions for liveness preservation (projects_run, projects_run_of_visible, transfer_eventually, transfer_infinitelyOften).\n\nAxiom manifests per ADR-0035: lean/AxiomManifest.lean (Lean.collectAxioms, fails on missing declarations) generates lean/artifacts/axiom-manifest-t0-t1.json and .txt; lean/scripts/axiom-manifest.sh regenerates or verifies (--check). All 68 manifest rows report zero axioms - not even propext/Quot.sound. The reflective checkers use a hand-rolled axiom-free Boolean layer (Continuum.Reflect) because core List.all / decide-membership lemmas route through propext. Two pre-existing non-T0/T1 theorems still report propext (cancel_step_decreases_rank, solution_ends_with_four_gallons), unchanged from bn-fak5's baseline.\n\nVerification: lake clean + lake build clean (19 jobs), lake env lean Continuum.lean clean, lake env lean --version = 4.32.1, scripts/axiom-manifest.sh --check passes, no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide/set_option in Continuum/. 78 authored theorems total (was 24). Only lean/ touched."}	blake3:WUwx8g4Xvl7aL2JoK1sNwDlhDq57ogRAimBqW1Qe4_8
